WEBVTT

00:00:00.200 --> 00:00:05.029
Today we will appreciate work using evidence. Our work connects with selected artists

00:00:05.029 --> 00:00:06.515
and traditions in Ghana.

00:00:07.367 --> 00:00:12.636
Describe visible lines, colours, textures and shapes. Name a design choice that a

00:00:12.636 --> 00:00:14.663
selected Ghanaian artist might make.

00:00:15.533 --> 00:00:18.627
Say which details help communicate the artist’s idea.

00:00:19.533 --> 00:00:23.245
Give one evidence-based compliment and one possible improvement.
